'''Wolves Esports''' is the esports division of [[:category:England|English]] [[wikipedia:Association_football|football]] team [[wikipedia:Wolverhampton_Wanderers_Football_Club|Wolverhampton Wanderers]]. They have a highly-competitive [[callofduty:Wolves_(Chinese_Team)|Call of Duty Mobile]] team based in China. Wolves Esports also fields teams in both China and Europe across their esports divisions.

